  "body": "The W3C's Shadow DOM spec [modified sequential focus navigation behavior](http://w3c.github.io/webcomponents/spec/shadow/#sequential-focus-navigation) to take into account the state of the [`delegatesFocus` flag](https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/367) given when creating ShadowRoots. This behavior should be brought into the WHATWG HTML spec.",
